---
const dl = 'https://github.com/reneweteling/stayawake/releases/latest/download/StayAwake.dmg';
---
<section class="block" id="install">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Install</h2>
    <p class="lede">macOS 14 or newer on Apple Silicon. Signed and notarized, free for noncommercial use.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Download <a href={dl}>StayAwake.dmg</a> from the latest release.</li>
      <li>Drag StayAwake into Applications.</li>
      <li>Approve the helper once in System Settings, Login Items. It never asks for your password.</li>
      <li>Click the moon in the menu bar and flip Stay awake.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="src">
      <p>Or build it yourself:</p>
      <pre class="term"><code><span class="p">$ </span>git clone https://github.com/reneweteling/stayawake.git
<span class="p">$ </span>cd stayawake && ./scripts/build.sh
<span class="p">$ </span>cp -R build/StayAwake.app /Applications/</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  ol { list-style: none; counter-reset: s; margin: 48px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 32px; }
  li { counter-increment: s; border-top: 1px solid #2c3c40; padding-top: 16px; color: var(--muted); }
  li::before { content: counter(s); display: block; font: 500 14px/1 var(--mono); color: var(--dim); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  li a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  li a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .src { margin-top: 56px; max-width: 640px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .src p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
  .src code { background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; white-space: pre; font-size: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) { ol { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { ol { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; } }
</style>
